menu "I2C: Inter-Integrated Circuit"

# ==================================
# I2C
# ==================================
config MR_USE_DRIVER_I2C
    depends on MR_USE_DRIVER
    bool "Use I2C"
    default n
    help
        Enable the I2C bus controller driver framework.
        Features:
            - Master message transfers with repeated START support
            - Slave receive/transmit data paths
            - 7-bit and 10-bit addressing
            - Explicit STOP/NOSTOP message control
            - Waitable interrupt/event notification
        DMA and interrupt transfer details are provided by controller backends.

endmenu
